      "importance": 70,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该内容来自OpenAI高管，提供了评估AI投资回报的实用框架，对企业决策者有参考价值，但缺乏具体数据支持。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "The content comes from an OpenAI executive, offering a practical framework for evaluating AI ROI, valuable for business decision-makers, but lacks specific data support.",
