      "summaryZh": "Google Vids 推出两项重大更新：引入 Gemini Omni 模型，以及支持用户创建个人化身，让视频创作变得更加简单直观。",
      "summaryEn": "Google Vids introduces two major updates: the Gemini Omni model and personal avatars, making video creation easier and more intuitive.",
